WEBVTT

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.440
Spaced out...

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:20.580
It looks like Sis is thinking about Clear again.

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.550
What kind of person is he?

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:27.710
That guy Clear...

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.420
Kaze won't tell us anything.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:36.430
This is the first time
I've ever seen Sis act like this.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:41.900
Cid!

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:50.840
This thing has amazing flying abilities!

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.800
What's this all about?

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.940
It's an experiment.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.580
What kind of experiment?

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:02.150
On the Flying Water that Ai brought back!

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.690
Clear's Flying Water!

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:14.840
I looked into it, and this glove
is definitely made from

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:17.210
Flying Water that has been
processed into fibers.

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.270
As part of the test, I tried riding it.

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:22.380
Wow! The gravitational resistance
and acceleration are so good,

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:23.850
it's really quite incredible.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.340
Give it back!

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:30.710
Ouch, that wasn't very nice.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.620
Don't just take this and do experiments on it!

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:35.520
We're giving this back to Clear!

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:38.660
I'm sorry, I just couldn't help myself.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:39.720
Honestly!

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:46.220
I've got a bad, weird feeling.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.540
The Ocean Puzzle has...

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:58.110
Moved!

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:28.270
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:28.270
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:35.780
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:35.780
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:44.890
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:44.890
With our eyes on the future

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:50.990
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:50.990
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:54.640 --> 00:03:00.630
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:54.640 --> 00:03:00.630
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:08.140
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:08.140
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:13.850
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:13.850
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:23.350
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:23.350
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:36.240
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:42.100
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.910
The boy who holds the power to destroy, Clear...

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.280
His encounter and parting with Ai...

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:56.350
Now, fate is calling the one with a pure heart.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.590
Calling for him...

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.450
What's going on?!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.850
Cid! We're in the sky!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.190
Again?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.190
What's that?

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:38.960
Everyone hold on!

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.090
Look!

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:58.420
<i>What in the world is this big thing?</i>

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:02.390
<i>I'm getting a bad feeling that
I've never had before.</i>

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:08.200
This doesn't look good.
It looks like they're aiming for us.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:13.200
It looks like we're stuck
and can't move, right, Cid?

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:15.070
Yeah.

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.840
Being up in the sky here, there's really
nothing we can do anyway.

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.550
You're right.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.450
All right, all hands prepare for battle!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.550
Prepare to fire the main cannon!

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.350
I've got it in my sights!

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.940
Take in a deep, strong breath!

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.880
Exhale!

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:20.540
So it was no good. They've got
that defense system set up

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:24.240
with those four satellites protecting
the structure in the middle.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.880
Knave, let's give the main cannon one more try!

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:27.870
Wait!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:34.250
It seems like Jane is safe for now because the
satellites apparently cannot fire at each other.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:36.960
It means we'll be all right for the time being.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:40.090
I think we should take our time
and think of an escape plan.

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:43.590
Yeah, you're right. Cid, you're absolutely right.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:45.290
Right, Knave?!

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:49.760
It means we can't make a careless move.

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:54.670
<i>Mist...</i>

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:01.850
Whoa there, I was planning for them
to land on Gaudium,

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.650
but they got themselves caught
in the defense satellites.

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:12.990
His Excellency is really quite wicked,
wanting to play around with them like this.

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:18.830
What's wrong, Chobi?

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.100
He said he smells Dead Peppers
and can't take it.

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:25.570
Dead Peppers?

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:32.000
That stuff we saw in that weird mansion
that look like red peppers?

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.440
Where is a smell like that coming from?

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:55.500
No, Chobi!

00:07:58.610 --> 00:07:59.610
Chobi!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.270
Yu!

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.830
Jane!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.380
Yu!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.380
Help me!

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:23.730
Chobi...

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:32.300
Where am I?

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:44.080
Chobi! Where are you?!

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:47.790
Chobi!

00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:09.870
Ouch!

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:15.610
What are you doing? This is pretty rude of you.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:19.450
I'm sorry, I didn't think
you were that close to me.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.680
Hey, do you live here?

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.350
Yeah, that's right.

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:30.790
You haven't seen a Chocobo
around here, have you?

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.000
His name is Chobi, but...

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.240
Chobi?

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:36.790
Oh, a bird, right?

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.870
Have you seen him? He's my friend!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.480
Your friend? A bird?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.180
What's so funny?

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:54.420
Because he's a bird. Birds are food.

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.520
It's weird to be friends with your food.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:04.700
Hey you, you can't keep living like that
here in Wonderland.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:08.900
Because here, the winners are the ones
who trample the weak.

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:10.940
People like me.

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:14.880
That's not a good thing.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.210
Why?

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:21.480
Well, I think maybe that's why
Wonderland is so messed up.

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:23.650
Messed up?

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.650
You're really funny, you know that?

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.480
You want a lick?

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:37.090
How strange. When I'm around you, my stomach feels full, and it puts me in a good mood.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:44.200
Hey, why have you come to Wonderland?

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:50.440
Oh, I'm searching for my mom and dad.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.440
Mom and dad?

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:56.110
Our last name is Hayakawa.

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:59.620
Hayakawa? Oh!

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.220
You know them?!

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:03.460
Those guys, right?

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.790
Dad! Mom!

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:30.310
Cid, what are you doing?

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.010
I'm going to take this satellite.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.020
The ultrasonic waves from this
Genevieve Haute Couture

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:38.360
will allow me to create a remote link
with the satellite.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:44.430
Wasn't Genevieve the machine that you used
to fix Chocobo when he was acting weird?

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.600
I have a feeling something terrible's
going to happen.

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:00.210
Is that going to be able to help Yu?

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:02.180
Of course!

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:11.220
Dad! Mom!

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:24.310
Dad... Mom...

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:28.340
They are researching to help make
my dream a reality.

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:30.640
They're really being a big help!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:34.750
It is my dream to own and control
all of Wonderland,

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:38.950
the Outside World, space and everything else.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:40.990
Everything?

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.980
That's right. They said it too.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:47.330
That it would be the first time they had
done such fun research.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:50.560
Why?!

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.560
Mom and Dad...

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:56.270
They said solving the mystery of Wonderland

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:59.670
could be a promising lead
to developing new energy.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:07.280
But to have neglected us to work here...

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.580
Dad...

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.400
Who are you?

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:43.410
My name is Tyrant.
But people call me the Earl.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.920
The Earl...

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:52.920
This can't be.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:57.020
What's wrong? Are you scared?

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:05.840
Chobi!

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:09.440
Wait!

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:15.780
Dad, Mom!

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:24.450
All right, that should do it.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.930
I've taken care of the hole.

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:29.420
All right. Cid, how's it going on your end?

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:32.930
It's working, it's working...

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:36.330
The link has been completed!

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:44.070
That's right! I'm such a genius!

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.980
All right, let's get going then!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.990
So we can rescue Yu and Chobi!

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:17.040
It's that guy!

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:18.100
Makenshi!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:30.780
Stop it! Yu and Chobi are over there!

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:33.430
Let me go.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:36.950
If you want to fight, do it after
we save Yu and Chobi!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.080
Jane!

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:00.180
And we just repaired that!

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.100
Yu!

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.630
Stop it, you'll hit Yu!

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:19.140
It has moved!

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.110
You're in my way!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:22.400
All things...

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:25.280
Ride my beautiful song...

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:27.840
And be off!

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:35.090
Nocturne of the White Heat!

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:54.260
Oh, no! Cid!

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:57.870
I can't! It will put Yu and Chobi
in danger if I counterattack!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.810
Soil is my power!

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.410
Stop it, Mister!

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.240
Chobi! Yu!

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:28.170
Yu!

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:29.640
Yu!

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:30.670
Yu!

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:33.810
Yu! Say something!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:56.490
Wow! What amazing energy to be able
to clear the stage like that!

00:17:58.310 --> 00:17:59.600
That Makenshi...

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:09.740
That was pretty cool of you, Makenshi darling!

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:15.280
But it sure was disappointing,
the way the ship got away.

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:19.850
I thought that you might not come back,
and I was worried, Makenshi!

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:24.470
In destroying the defense satellite
that the enemy had taken over,

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:28.420
and protecting Gaudium and
His Excellency the Earl,

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:32.270
you were magnificent, Lord Makenshi.

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:37.340
You're really the one I can depend on
the most, aren't you, Makenshi?

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:42.370
Do you want a lick?

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:45.510
My thanks.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:57.530
I'm so sorry, Jane!
I'm going to fix you up right away!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.500
You're really terrible to my Jane!

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:13.410
By the way, who was that guy anyway?

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.450
That guy...

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:21.320
Makenshi! It almost looked like he
destroyed the satellite on purpose

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:23.220
so that Jane could get away.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:30.360
He once destroyed the
Comodeen's secret hideout,

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.460
so I don't have a great impression of him,

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:35.740
but considering that last incident...

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:37.330
What do you think?

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:48.700
He is my mortal enemy.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:51.420
Oh, well...

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:55.260
Even so, that impregnable defense...

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:57.780
That structure is probably...

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.160
Gaudium?

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:01.890
I'm sure of it!

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:06.100
That place is the Castle of Chaos,
the home of the Earl.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.470
I've heard of that place before.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.090
The Earl's castle? Then what about Yu?

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:17.080
Yu...

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:22.110
Hey, Yu, are you all right? What happened?

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.880
Nothing....

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:28.320
Never mind.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
Soshite tabi wa hajimaru

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Just the two of us going off

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Kimi to futari doko ka e

