Here is my prophecy.

00:22:25.470 --> 00:22:29.030
The black water that attacks
the desert and steals life...

00:22:29.410 --> 00:22:32.500
Kaze, Lisa, Cid, the Comodeen...

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:36.280
